<title>UK: M. Lynch names Krengel to Latam equity sales team.</title>
<headline>M. Lynch names Krengel to Latam equity sales team.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Europe Plc said on Wednesday it had appointed Janet Krengel as part of its Latin America equity sales team in London.</p>
<p>Krengel, expected to start in April, is currently a senior economist at IBCA Sovereign Ratings Ltd.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7770 (fax +44 171 583 7239)</p>
